<p><em>Note: not a greenlighter.</em></p>
<p>Hey <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/negative360" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6226240); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6226240&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1600550412" alt="Negative360" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6226240)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/negative360" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6226240); return false;">Negative360</a></span>, I've come to give some crit. Forgive me if these things have already been said, or aren't helpful to you.</p>
<div class="collapsible-block">
