<p>-The interview log is unnecessary at this stage, as the concept and article are likely to change a fair bit before the final draft.- Should also note that drafting at this stage is also unnecessary, as the article is (very likely) going to need multiple edits before its finished.</p>
<p><strong>Overall concept:</strong></p>
