<p><span style="text-decoration: line-through;">Here, have a Placeholder. I will crit this when wikidot stops dying. Hopefully within 24 hours.</span></p>
<p>I was summoned yesterday by IRC Chat, but then wikidot died :/ Anyway, let's crit this.</p>
